# Downloaded ML weights and caches.
#
# ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, and that is not cosmetic. These were
# previously written as `models/`, `checkpoints/`, `cache/` — with no
# slash, a git pattern matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, so
# `models/` silently excluded `backend/app/models/` and every ORM model
# file went uncommitted for weeks. `app/models/__init__.py` stayed
# tracked only because it predated the rule (.gitignore does not affect
# already-tracked files), which is why `git status` never showed the
# others as untracked and a fresh clone could not start at all.
#
# Keep these anchored, and never add an unanchored directory name that
# could collide with a source directory.
/models/
/checkpoints/
/cache/
# BGE-M3 weights, when the container's volume is bind-mounted locally.
backend/model_cache/


